Currently Grey & Silver Dragon Scale Mail are the 2 favorite choices for
DSM.  I'd like to see the other DSM colors more worthwhile, so that
there'd be more diversity to choose from.  This YANI is an attempt to
make the other DSM colors more useful, in a hopefully interesting way.

The idea is that there be a specific artifact weapon for every DSM
except Grey & Silver (and possibly Yellow, 'cause I can't think of a
good combo, and acid resistance can't be gained by eating, same as magic
& reflection), that when wearing the DSM & wielding the artifact gives a
special bonus.  Below are my ideas for combos, lemme know what you
think, or if there's a different combo you think would be better.

White DSM + Frost Brand = gains the +d5 to-hit & x2 damage bonus to all
monsters, regardless of Cold resistance.

Red DSM + Fire Brand = gains the +d5 to-hit & x2 damage bonus to all
monsters, regardless of Fire resistance.

Blue DSM + Mjollnir = gains +d24 damage against monsters that ARE shock
resistant, and +3d12 damage against monsters that are NOT shock
resistant.  For Valkyries, increases the chance for thrown Mjollnir both
to return & return to hand from 99% to 100%.  For non-Valkyrie
characters, thrown Mjollnir has a 75% chance to return, and 50% chance
to return to hand.  If Mjollnir returns, but not to hand, it will land
at your feet 100% of the time, with no chance to be hit.

Green DSM + Longbow of Diana = every arrow fired is poisoned (10%
instadeath, else +d6 damage), and gains an additional +d12 damage to all
monsters.

Orange DSM + Stormbringer = Asks for confirmation when attacking tame or
peaceful monsters (Stormy's evil spirit is asleep); gains the +5 to-hit
& +d2 damage to all monsters, even level-drain-resistant (but will not
drain levels if the target is resistant).

Black DSM + "targeted" Artifact weapon ([species]bane, Giantslayer,
Ogresmasher) = 1/3 chance to disintegrate targeted species.


